The reason rocks work best for killing Sokoban monsters that
block boulder movement: When you push a boulder into one of
the Sokoban pits you don't want items of even small value in
those spots.  Since rocks are a nearly unlimited resource they
are the weapon to use.  It might just barely be worth digging to
retrieve a bunch of darts or whatever but you can always go get
a few dozen more rocks.

Whenever there's a blocking monster, bring several dozen rocks.
Make sure you have a lot of spares because if you have to go
back for more the monster heals while you lug.




